# Horn of the Frostwolf Howler for Exalted Frostwolf Clan (Era rule; the
# reputation comes from Alterac Valley, one of Forever's four battlegrounds).
# Sources: Forever client 1.60.1.70338 tables via wago.tools (ItemSparse: level
# 60, 200g, no riding rank asked); items.json / npcs.json for the vendors.

step Frostwolf Clan
  tip Alterac Valley (level 51+) raises Frostwolf Clan: win, capture towers and graveyards, and hand in the battleground's turn-ins. Jekyll Flandring waits at the Horde end of Alterac Mountains outside the battleground; Grunnda Wolfheart inside Alterac Valley sells the same mount.
  rep "Frostwolf Clan" Exalted

step Horn of the Frostwolf Howler
  tip The Forever client lists it at 200g and level 60, and asks for no riding rank.
  level 60
  buy 19029 npc 13219                 -- Jekyll Flandring, 200g
